WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.670 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.920 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:49.920 --> 01:51.170
What is that?!

01:52.090 --> 01:54.090
<i>Fin, lend me your power!</i>

01:54.090 --> 01:56.670
- <i>Deliver my wish to...!</i>

01:54.880 --> 01:56.670
- No,

01:55.510 --> 01:56.670
I

01:56.050 --> 01:56.670
won't !!!

01:57.680 --> 02:01.430
- Hello! Maron, I'm back!

02:01.430 --> 02:04.310
Fin! Is that you, Fin?! Where are you?!

02:05.430 --> 02:07.350
Right before your eyes.

02:12.690 --> 02:14.610
W-Who are you?

02:14.610 --> 02:17.900
What? You've already forgotten about me?

02:17.900 --> 02:19.360
Could you be...?

02:19.360 --> 02:21.620
Yeah, that's Fin.

02:22.910 --> 02:23.950
Fin-chan...

02:24.580 --> 02:26.540
No way! That's Fin?!

02:27.750 --> 02:30.500
Yes, I'm Fin...

02:30.500 --> 02:32.500
...Fallen Angel Fin Fish!

02:32.500 --> 02:34.960
Fallen Angel Fin...?!

02:37.510 --> 02:41.970
Kaitou, Surpass Space and Time!!

02:54.400 --> 02:56.480
Foolish human...

02:56.480 --> 03:01.110
You continued to seal Demons without knowing that I was just using you.

03:01.110 --> 03:07.540
Maron, I was able to safely deliver the chess pieces you collected to the Devil.

03:09.540 --> 03:10.290
The Devil...

03:11.370 --> 03:14.170
Fin-chan! Turn back into a Semi-Angel!

03:16.670 --> 03:20.930
Look... Thanks to you, this is my power.

03:20.930 --> 03:23.640
The Devil's strength has increased dramatically.

03:23.640 --> 03:28.310
The sealing of Demons, which you thought was for God...

03:28.310 --> 03:28.930
Fin...

03:28.930 --> 03:31.140
...was for the Devil.

03:34.480 --> 03:39.190
Maron! I hated you from the very beginning!

03:39.190 --> 03:40.610
No...

03:45.740 --> 03:48.540
Would you like me to tell you the truth?

03:48.540 --> 03:50.040
My goal was to...

03:50.040 --> 03:52.370
- Don't listen to Fin!

03:51.460 --> 03:52.370
- Nagoya-kun!

03:55.040 --> 03:59.960
I suggest you don't say anything, or else I can't ensure the safety of your pet.

04:01.550 --> 04:06.010
...torment your heart, reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc!

04:06.970 --> 04:10.520
Torment after torment, filling it with evil...

04:10.520 --> 04:13.190
...and eliminating God's barrier!

04:17.440 --> 04:22.570
This is all because God fell in love with a human girl.

04:22.570 --> 04:25.780
God...fell in love with a human girl?

04:25.780 --> 04:26.820
Yes.

04:30.080 --> 04:33.790
That human girl was Jeanne d'Arc.

04:33.790 --> 04:35.670
Jeanne d'Arc...

04:35.670 --> 04:40.130
Since ancient times, God and the Devil have continuously been fighting each other...

04:41.550 --> 04:46.680
Their powers became equal, and the result was an impasse.

04:48.010 --> 04:50.310
Then...

04:52.230 --> 04:55.020
God met Jeanne d'Arc.

04:56.060 --> 05:00.730
Jeanne was a pure-hearted believer in God.

05:00.730 --> 05:04.900
God forgot He was God, fell in love with Jeanne...

05:04.900 --> 05:08.870
...gave the majority of His power to Jeanne and protected her.

05:08.870 --> 05:11.450
Because of that, God's power diminished....

05:11.450 --> 05:14.830
...and seeing this as a chance, the Devil waged war on God.

05:18.710 --> 05:23.670
However, despite almost succeeding, he could not defeat God.

05:23.670 --> 05:26.130
The Devil then thought...

05:26.130 --> 05:31.180
"In order to weaken God, you have to weaken His powers from the inside."

05:31.180 --> 05:36.690
"Just kill His love, Jeanne, right before His eyes and make Him go insane."

05:40.690 --> 05:43.570
The Devil sent Demons to Earth...

05:43.570 --> 05:46.650
...and ordered them to kill Jeanne.

05:47.570 --> 05:51.200
But God's barrier protecting Jeanne was strong...

05:51.200 --> 05:54.870
...and the Demons could not even touch Jeanne.

05:56.160 --> 05:58.880
The Devil changed tactics.

05:58.880 --> 06:04.920
He had the Demons possess people around Jeanne and had them betray her.

06:06.090 --> 06:08.840
Yes, just like you.

06:09.840 --> 06:12.560
It was so amusing to see Jeanne's heart in chaos.

06:12.560 --> 06:15.390
The barrier became weaker and weaker.

06:15.390 --> 06:17.310
The plan was a success.

06:19.310 --> 06:23.110
Jeanne died horrendously, right before God's eyes.

06:24.110 --> 06:29.360
God used Jeanne's heart and left her to die!

06:32.280 --> 06:33.080
That can't be...

06:34.370 --> 06:42.210
The Devil engaged in battle again after Jeanne died, and God's powers had diminished.

06:42.210 --> 06:46.260
However, God fought back vigorously, and the score was never settled.

06:46.260 --> 06:49.380
And 500 years later, you were born.

06:49.380 --> 06:50.470
Me?

06:51.390 --> 06:57.890
God could not forget about Jeanne, so He resurrected her in a different body.

06:57.890 --> 07:01.350
That was you...

06:59.770 --> 07:01.350
Kusakabe Maron!

07:07.820 --> 07:11.030
What comes after this may be painful to hear.

07:12.620 --> 07:18.120
In order to finish God once and for all, the Devil narrowed down the target to you.

07:18.120 --> 07:21.500
That's why the Demons possessed my parents.

07:21.500 --> 07:25.380
Yes, so that he can steal your parents' love from you.

07:25.380 --> 07:26.710
Terrible...

07:27.920 --> 07:34.300
God was afraid to lose you, too, so He sent an Angel down to Earth to watch over you.

07:35.850 --> 07:38.100
<i>Hi, Maron!</i>

07:38.100 --> 07:41.890
And I was the one for the job.

07:41.890 --> 07:46.900
God never knew I was a Fallen Angel, who had already sworn loyalty to the Devil.

07:56.200 --> 07:57.450
I don't want to believe it!

08:02.540 --> 08:04.540
Jeanne's barrier has weakened.

08:04.540 --> 08:05.380
Now!!!

08:05.380 --> 08:07.550
Don't interfere!

08:10.800 --> 08:12.970
Access! Are you all right?!

08:14.470 --> 08:17.560
Fin-chan wasn't a Fallen Angel from the beginning.

08:17.560 --> 08:20.270
She was just brainwashed by the Devil!

08:20.270 --> 08:22.480
My, that's an interesting story.

08:22.480 --> 08:26.150
I saw it! Fin-chan was captured by the Devil and...

08:30.070 --> 08:31.190
<i>Fin-chan!!</i>

08:31.190 --> 08:35.820
<i>Access, don't follow me! I have an important meeting with God!</i>

08:37.200 --> 08:39.790
<i>Geez, I want to go to Earth...</i>

08:43.080 --> 08:44.790
<i>Fin-chan!</i>

08:44.790 --> 08:47.540
Access, save me!

08:47.540 --> 08:49.670
<i>Fin-chaaaaan!!!</i>

08:50.250 --> 08:55.180
Fin was captured, brainwashed and turned into a Fallen Angel!

08:57.260 --> 09:03.930
The Devil... The only one I can trust is the Devil...

09:06.900 --> 09:08.190
<i>Fin-chan...</i>

09:08.190 --> 09:13.110
The Devil transformed Fallen Angel Fin back into a Semi-Angel...

09:13.110 --> 09:16.660
...so that she could approach Maron without suspicion.

09:17.620 --> 09:22.200
That's why Fin-chan had the heart of an Angel the first time Maron met her.

09:24.580 --> 09:28.960
I immediately told God about this!

09:28.960 --> 09:33.800
God ordered me to protect Maron.

09:33.800 --> 09:36.880
And so I descended to Earth...

09:36.880 --> 09:40.680
...but I had no clue of what to do.

09:46.600 --> 09:48.650
<i>What the...? What a strange creature...</i>

09:48.650 --> 09:50.480
<i>Let me go! Let me go!</i>

09:50.480 --> 09:52.190
<i>Y-You can talk?!</i>

09:52.190 --> 09:54.860
Y-You can see me?!

09:54.860 --> 09:59.320
<i>Of course. I wouldn't grab you if I couldn't see you.</i>

09:59.320 --> 10:06.370
Then it came to me! I knew this guy would help me!

10:00.570 --> 10:06.370
Sinbad's Adventure

10:06.580 --> 10:10.130
So I told him the whole story and asked him to help me!

10:11.420 --> 10:13.300
That's a funny story.

10:13.300 --> 10:17.130
So you saw a movie board and decided on Sinbad?

10:17.130 --> 10:20.850
I gave Chiaki the power to <i>Checkmate</i> Demons!

10:21.850 --> 10:24.600
In order to stop contact with Fin and the Demons,

10:24.600 --> 10:29.230
I transformed into Sinbad and got into Jeanne's way.

10:29.230 --> 10:30.100
Chiaki...

10:32.230 --> 10:34.860
I was never brainwashed.

10:34.860 --> 10:38.200
From the beginning, I was in love with the Devil.

10:38.200 --> 10:42.280
You're wrong! Fin-chan, please, recall your Angel heart!

10:43.120 --> 10:44.120
You're annoying!

10:54.590 --> 10:58.090
I've belonged to the Devil ever since I was born.

10:58.090 --> 11:01.760
I gave you the Rosario and the Petit Claire...

11:01.760 --> 11:05.970
...and continued to deceive you, all for my darling Devil.

11:06.930 --> 11:11.020
Everything I've done was for the Devil...?

11:11.020 --> 11:13.980
Exactly. Do you finally understand?

11:13.980 --> 11:18.860
I've been helping out a plan to kill God and destroy Earth...

11:26.290 --> 11:27.950
The barrier is...!

11:27.950 --> 11:31.500
Now, Noin, it is time to fulfill your wish.

11:31.500 --> 11:35.460
Don't you want to remove Jeanne d'Arc's soul from Maron?

11:35.460 --> 11:37.500
Noin! Why are you hesitating?!

11:40.170 --> 11:41.380
<i>Jeanne!</i>

11:50.060 --> 11:51.770
<i>Jeanne d'Arc!!!</i>

11:54.100 --> 11:57.400
<i>I will despise God for all eternity!</i>

11:57.400 --> 12:03.240
I won't forgive God for leaving the woman I love out to die!

12:05.660 --> 12:07.160
Please stop!

12:07.450 --> 12:08.870
Maron! Hold strong!

12:09.660 --> 12:13.120
Don't let Fallen Angel Fin's words trick you!

12:13.120 --> 12:16.460
She's trying to torture your heart and weaken your powers!

12:16.460 --> 12:18.840
I... I...

12:18.840 --> 12:22.630
I tried to tell you about Fin several times...

12:22.630 --> 12:28.470
But you'd never believe that Fin was brainwashed by the Devil...

12:28.470 --> 12:30.020
Even if you did believe me,

12:30.020 --> 12:35.770
I thought of how much of a shock you'd be in, so I was never able to tell you.

12:38.190 --> 12:42.900
If you went in shock, God's barrier would weaken, and your life would be in danger.

12:42.900 --> 12:46.700
So the only thing I could do was to become Sinbad and get in your way!

12:46.700 --> 12:48.660
Maron, believe me!

12:48.660 --> 12:51.330
It's a lie. I don't think you should trust him.

12:51.330 --> 12:56.250
Sinbad, Access, and everyone else, including me, were all just deceiving you.

12:56.250 --> 12:58.750
Stop! I don't want to hear any more of it!

12:58.750 --> 13:00.630
I can't believe it!

13:00.630 --> 13:04.630
Poor girl. She didn't have a clue that the whole thing was a setup.

13:07.180 --> 13:08.760
The barrier is gone!

13:17.600 --> 13:18.730
Maron!

13:20.190 --> 13:23.690
Nagoya-kun! I told you not to interfere!

13:23.690 --> 13:26.820
The time has come to settle the score with God!

13:31.910 --> 13:34.080
Noooooo!!!

13:41.840 --> 13:43.260
Maron!!!

13:52.680 --> 13:57.810
<i>You don't have a family? Then, I'll be your family!</i>

13:57.810 --> 14:01.480
<i>Geez, what are you talking about? Wanting to quit being a Kaitou...</i>

14:01.480 --> 14:06.900
<i>The only one who can seal the Demons is you, the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

14:06.900 --> 14:10.950
<i>If you have anything troubling you, I want you to come straight to me.</i>

14:10.950 --> 14:16.870
<i>Thank you so much for listening to my wish. Thank you so, so much...</i>

14:17.920 --> 14:19.330
<i>Fin...!</i>

14:42.310 --> 14:44.150
Where am...?

14:44.150 --> 14:46.030
- You must be Kusakabe Maron.

14:48.200 --> 14:50.200
I have been waiting for you to come.

14:51.370 --> 14:52.700
For me?

14:56.790 --> 14:58.910
You're...Jeanne d'Arc!

15:04.130 --> 15:11.300
God told me that you would come here weary, tortured and heartbroken...

15:11.300 --> 15:15.510
He told me to help keep you from making the same mistake I did.

15:16.390 --> 15:18.480
Maron, be courageous.

15:19.690 --> 15:20.980
Maron!

15:21.310 --> 15:24.820
I can't! I don't know what I can believe in.

15:24.820 --> 15:27.440
I can't hear the voice of God!

15:27.440 --> 15:35.030
I believe in God. But, I didn't fight because I heard God's voice.

15:35.030 --> 15:40.790
Whether I heard God's voice or not, I listened to my heart's voice...

15:40.790 --> 15:43.830
...and fought for what I believed in.

15:44.790 --> 15:50.300
However, because of the Devil, everyone I believed in betrayed me...

15:50.300 --> 15:52.630
...and I let my heart go insane.

15:52.630 --> 15:54.720
Just as you are right now.

15:58.930 --> 16:03.520
Because of this, I could not believe the words of the man I loved from the bottom of my heart.

16:03.520 --> 16:07.110
I could not even hear the voice of my own heart.

16:07.570 --> 16:08.860
Believe...

16:08.860 --> 16:11.360
...the words of the man you love from the bottom of your heart...

16:11.360 --> 16:13.990
Maron, believe me!

16:16.780 --> 16:21.620
Kusakabe Maron, you mustn't make the same mistake that I made.

16:21.620 --> 16:24.330
No matter what the people around you say,

16:24.330 --> 16:26.420
you must believe in yourself!

16:27.670 --> 16:31.510
You have always believed in yourself.

16:31.510 --> 16:34.800
You have continued to believe in the one you love.

16:34.800 --> 16:38.310
But, Jeanne d'Arc! You are courageous!

16:38.310 --> 16:42.020
I'm just a cowardly weakling...

16:42.020 --> 16:44.900
I'm not strong at all!

16:44.900 --> 16:46.270
I am the same.

16:46.270 --> 16:50.440
If I didn't have the support and encouragement of the people closest to me...

16:50.440 --> 16:52.490
People who have supported and encouraged me...

16:52.490 --> 16:54.530
<i>Maron!</i>

16:57.780 --> 16:58.870
I, too, have...

17:01.410 --> 17:04.620
Noin Claude! I know you're there!

17:04.620 --> 17:10.250
You knew... It has been a long time, Jeanne d'Arc-sama.

17:11.920 --> 17:14.510
Chiaki! Chiaki!!!

17:14.510 --> 17:16.390
Maron, I'm glad you're safe.

17:16.390 --> 17:17.140
Chiaki...

17:17.890 --> 17:22.060
You have him. Just as Noin was always by my side.

17:22.770 --> 17:23.980
Jeanne-sama...

17:30.980 --> 17:38.240
Maron, please go back to your time and change your important friend Fin back into a pure Angel.

17:39.320 --> 17:40.700
That's right, Maron.

17:40.700 --> 17:41.490
Yes...

17:42.240 --> 17:46.460
Strong and serious... Matchless and marvelous... Energetic and courageous!

17:48.460 --> 17:52.250
Noin, please help us. Send them back to their original--

17:52.250 --> 17:55.880
I cannot just leave you here to die!

17:57.180 --> 18:00.390
Right now, I have the powers of the Demons!

18:00.390 --> 18:04.060
I will save you before you are burned at the stake tomorrow!

18:04.060 --> 18:05.890
You cannot do that!

18:05.890 --> 18:07.810
My work is done.

18:07.810 --> 18:12.230
All that is left is for Maron to take on my will and fight the Devil.

18:12.230 --> 18:15.990
I...don't care about God or the Devil!

18:15.990 --> 18:19.450
Right now, we must weaken the Devil's power and save the people...

18:19.450 --> 18:23.660
...or else there will be more who will suffer, just like you did!

18:23.660 --> 18:26.080
Like...me?

18:29.210 --> 18:32.420
Are you sure you want it this way?

18:33.050 --> 18:37.470
I do not regret anything that I have believed in.

18:37.470 --> 18:41.970
By meeting you, I was able to defeat solitude.

18:41.970 --> 18:46.890
I will engrave our memories into my heart, and store them for all eternity.

18:46.890 --> 18:49.350
I had a happy life.

18:50.150 --> 18:51.560
Jeanne-sama...

18:51.560 --> 18:54.860
Think of me as Maron and protect her!

18:54.860 --> 18:57.860
Even if my life ends...!

19:02.990 --> 19:04.120
Noin...

19:15.460 --> 19:17.590
We're back.

19:17.590 --> 19:18.670
Yeah...

19:18.670 --> 19:20.550
But where's Noin?

19:20.550 --> 19:22.800
- Sinbaaaaad!!!

19:22.800 --> 19:24.550
Access!

19:24.550 --> 19:26.770
I'm so glad you two are okay!

19:26.770 --> 19:29.560
I was wondering what I was going to do all alone!

19:29.560 --> 19:33.860
But even if I was the only one left, Fin-chan...

19:33.860 --> 19:35.770
I got it! Stop crying!

19:35.770 --> 19:39.530
Access! I promise I will change Fin back to normal!

19:39.530 --> 19:40.780
Thanks, Jeanne!

19:40.780 --> 19:43.990
Maron! Chiaki! Where in the world have you two been?!

19:43.990 --> 19:45.200
Miyako!

19:45.200 --> 19:48.040
You've worried me so much...!

19:48.040 --> 19:49.870
Miyako, run!

19:49.870 --> 19:51.160
What's the matter, Maron?

19:54.960 --> 19:55.790
Maron!

19:55.790 --> 19:57.210
Transform!

19:57.210 --> 19:58.760
But Miyako is...!

20:03.550 --> 20:06.100
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power!</i>

20:27.660 --> 20:29.950
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

20:29.950 --> 20:32.120
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

20:32.120 --> 20:33.750
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

20:40.380 --> 20:44.130
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

20:47.220 --> 20:48.680
M-Maron is...

20:50.220 --> 20:52.350
...Kaitou Jeanne!

20:59.070 --> 21:00.440
In the name of God...

21:02.570 --> 21:04.950
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

21:07.410 --> 21:10.410
I seal you here!

21:20.420 --> 21:22.050
<i>Checkmate!</i>

21:29.010 --> 21:30.680
<i>Collection completed!</i>

21:33.930 --> 21:35.310
Jeanne, stop right there!

21:35.310 --> 21:36.440
Fin!

21:36.440 --> 21:37.480
Fin-chan!

21:38.100 --> 21:41.320
I'm so amazed with you!

21:41.320 --> 21:43.900
You regained your powers so quickly.

21:43.900 --> 21:46.530
Fin, please! Let go of Miyako!

21:46.530 --> 21:52.580
No. As long as you exist on Earth, all the people around you will become miserable.

21:53.660 --> 21:56.330
I'll be taking your friend.

22:11.260 --> 22:13.770
What's going on?!

22:28.610 --> 22:35.200
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.670
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.210 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.850
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.050 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.830 --> 23:17.950
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.540 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.250 --> 23:30.090
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:47.730 --> 23:52.360
Kaitou Jeanne, I, Toudaiji Miyako, will finally bring you to justice!

23:52.360 --> 23:54.950
Miyako, please! Don't listen to the Demon's voice!

23:54.950 --> 23:57.200
I won't be fooled anymore!

23:57.200 --> 23:59.250
Give me back my Maron!

23:59.250 --> 24:04.000
No, the weak Maron, the strong Jeanne... They're both me!

24:04.000 --> 24:05.000
Shut up!

24:05.000 --> 24:09.420
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Friendship Destroyed?! Final Battle at the Evil Castle of Ice

24:09.460 --> 24:12.880
If you die, my Maron will return!
